<title>SINGAPORE: China raises domestic oil product prices-source.</title>
<headline>China raises domestic oil product prices-source.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>China has raised the ex-refinery price for diesel by 200 yuan per tonne to 2,190 yuan per tonne, fuel oil by 100 yuan to 1,000 yuan per tonne and gasoline by 100 yuan to 2,280 yuan per tonne, a SINOPEC source said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
